The MOVE-IT DEFEAT dataset contains synthetic patient-level data, generated from pseudonymised patient-level data collected over six survey waves, and includes individuals with long COVID, ex-COVID, and no COVID.
- Rows represent patients.
- Columns represent assessed variables (ending indicates survey wave).

#Included survey waves:
_A = Defeat 1 survey
_B = Defeat 2 survey
_C = Defeat 3 survey
_D = Defeat 4 survey
_rheuma = Rhematism survey
_OAC = Outpatient Assessment Clinic survey


#Included questionnaires:
- EQ-5D (_A, _B, _C, _D, _rheuma)
- FAS (_B, _C, _D, _rheuma)
- GAD-7 (_B, _C, _D)
- IMET (_A, _C)
- PHQ-9 (_B, _C)
- PSPQ (_B, _D)
- EFK (_B)
- PSS (_B)
- RS13 (_B)
- DePaul PEM (_D)


#Other included variables:
- demographic data
- health data (pre-existing diseases, Long-Covid symptoms, Covid infections & vaccinations)
